  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation EU support to address post conflict scenarios in southern Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The 20 million Euro Action seeks to support sustainable and inclusive economic recovery in Southern Lebanon through a needs-based approach following a post-conflict assessment.Objective: To contribute to medium and long-term  post-conflict recovery and stability in Lebanon.Specific objective: Support a sustainable and inclusive economic recovery in Southern Lebanon.Output: Support to business resumption, service delivery and entrepreneurship with a focus on sustainable agriculture and environmental protection.IF support to economic recovery is provided and forest and agricultural lands are restored, THEN displaced people will regain their livelihoods, engage in the labour market, poverty rates will reduce, social stability improve, and further displacement and migration will be curbed.</narrative>
  </description>
